"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcTokenSet","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12OidcTokenSetV"}],"title":"loginClientCredentials(scope:tenantID:configuration:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2\/token"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"grant_type=client_credentials"},{"text":" (§12.1) — service-account","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"login, and the operation §12.6 itself named as the one an embedded consumer wants.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)":{"abstract":[{"code":"POST \/oauth2\/token","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the RFC 8693 grant (§15.1).","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/tokenexchange(subjecttoken:subjecttokentype:actortoken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantid:configuration:)","title":"tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tokenExchange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"subjectToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectTokenType"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"